{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p051a","title":"曹操拒袁绍诛杨彪等之请","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p051a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》记袁绍欲借曹操诛杨彪、梁绍、孔融，曹操以应安众心为由拒绝，袁绍因此怨望。","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"id":"mantian-a-85d277d239a77674a224","label":"正文","text":"故太尉杨彪收付县狱","evidence":["mantian-q-c60776b9aeeeedbd7397"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-e05dc8fa075bcae96ba3","label":"裴注·《续汉书》","text":"袁术僭号后太祖与杨彪有隙，执彪将杀","evidence":["cuimao-q-10c55b478776223d5f53"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-4bb11d2ea1e7bff5e239","label":"裴注·《续汉书》","text":"孔融不及朝服往见太祖救杨彪，太祖意解遂理出彪","evidence":["cuimao-q-8d01637950950102e903"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"请诛","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拒绝","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0153","role":"拟被诛","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0154","role":"拟被诛","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0155","role":"拟被诛","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"与彪婚姻而僭号者","evidence":["cuimao-q-10c55b478776223d5f53"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p051a-q"]},"source_order":[1,357,"P051a"],"order":155}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0153","name":"杨彪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0154","name":"梁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0155","name":"孔融","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-10c55b478776223d5f53","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-886f0ad53f2bb55ec41b","layer":"pei","quote":"太尉杨彪与袁术婚姻。术僭号，太祖与彪有隙；因是执彪，将杀焉","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ed74dd0dffffddb82dc","start":8,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-8d01637950950102e903","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-886f0ad53f2bb55ec41b","layer":"pei","quote":"融闻之，不及朝服，往见太祖曰：‘杨公累世清德，四叶重光；《周书》“父子兄弟，罪不相及”，况以袁氏之罪乎？《易》称“积善余庆”，但欺人耳！”太祖曰：‘国家之意也。’融曰：‘假使成王欲杀召公，则周公可得言不知邪！今天下缨緌搢绅之士，所以瞻仰明公者，以明公聪明仁智，辅相汉朝，举直措枉，致之雍熙耳。今横杀无辜，则海内观听，谁不解体？孔融，鲁国男子，明日便当褰衣而去，不复朝矣！’太祖意解，遂理出彪","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ed74dd0dffffddb82dc","start":38,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-c60776b9aeeeedbd7397","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-ecac47e70b9f6d3d2aed","layer":"original","quote":"故太尉杨彪收付县狱〖9〗，尚书令荀彧、少府孔融等并属宠","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p051a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6aff33c5f292e9e37d04","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“袁绍宿与故太尉杨彪、大长秋梁绍、少府孔融有隙，欲使公以他过诛之。公曰：‘当今天下土崩瓦解，雄豪并起；辅相君长，人怀怏怏，各有自为之心：此上下相疑之秋也。虽以无嫌待之，犹惧未信；如有所除，则谁不自危？且夫起布衣，在尘垢之间，为庸人之所陵陷，可胜怨乎！高祖赦雍齿之仇而群情以安，如何忘之？’绍以为公外托公义，内实离异，深怀怨望。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cdd3bfb40221ff390ede","start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
